 - v1.8 removes in-game dragging for both character sprites and overlay layers. Legacy `chara` X/Y values and v1.6 save coordinates are migrated to the nearest fixed `left` / `center` / `right` anchor; layer composition coordinates remain script-defined for mouth/eye alignment.
